# gif.ski is a small open-source GIF encoder homepage; the project owner's
# server occasionally times out (35s+) during burst CI windows. The link is
# a casual "use this tool to convert mp4 -> gif" reference in
# docs/_assets/README.md, not a runtime dependency. Suppress to keep CI green.
^https://gif\.ski/?$

# OpenSSF Scorecard project page 404s until the first Scorecard scan runs on
# the repo. The badge image (with /badge suffix) responds 302 and renders
# correctly — this entry only suppresses the bare project link in the README.
^https://api\.securityscorecards\.dev/projects/github\.com/glacien-technologies/agent-guardian$

# docs/reference/roadmap.md links to a sibling .mdx file (roadmap.mdx) which
# ships in the Mintlify docs site build but is intentionally absent from the
# git tree per the .md stub's own preamble. CI runners therefore cannot resolve
# the file:// reference to roadmap.mdx, so we suppress it here.
roadmap\.mdx$

# The hosted demo "finbot" target in the README quickstart is a POST-only
# /chat endpoint, so a lychee GET returns 405 (not in the accept-list). The
# target is verified live out-of-band; suppress the README example URL here.
^https://agent-guardian-testbench-u6tm6gzysq-uc\.a\.run\.app/
